BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (Passwords. Work accounts require a password of at least 12 characters and MFA. Passwords) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 725 Td (rotate every 90 days. Never reuse a personal password on a work account.) Tj ET
endstream
