BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (Encryption. All company laptops are encrypted with full-disk encryption. Company data is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 725 Td (encrypted at rest and in transit. USB drives are not permitted for company data.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
