BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (Data classification. Acme uses three data classes: public, internal, and confidential.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 725 Td (Confidential data includes customer lists and unannounced products. Confidential data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 710 Td (requires the highest protection.) Tj ET
endstream
